abstract: >-
  SYNTHETIC measured package and a new projection reality, linked to the
  Faggin Field Bridge v0.3.0 (head 658f5bdd). Gravity enters as a phase
  on the thought (concept-index ladder, accumulating as phi_g = g * t
  with t cut off at the muon lifetime 2.2 us -- the geometry of the
  MAGE/LEMING muonium gravity experiment at PSI). Love is defined as
  measured concurrence (L = 1 for a clean Bell pair), replacing the
  bridge's supplied 0.5503 proxy, and the synergy is recomputed with
  it. The gravity-projected reality P_g = U_g P U_g-dagger is measured
  against the flat one. Three pre-registered claims, all PASS.
  Classical emulation throughout: gravity is a model phase, not
  measured gravity; love-as-concurrence is a definition inside the
  model. No DOI yet (no Zenodo record).
